  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commonwealth Election Professionals Initiative Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commonwealth Secretariat&apos;s election capability work is recognised throughout the multilateral system as the gold standard. This fourth phase of the Commonwealth Election Professional Initiative will build on the success of the previous three phases, and Secretariat&apos;s broader election capability work, to help developing country Commonwealth members hold free, fair and credible elections.</narrative>
